nt 协作定位受影响系统、测试并共享 shield、在不干扰工作负载的情况下部署。","title":"OpenAI 与 Cisco 发布开源 Linux 运行时 Shirudo，让 Agent 无停机防御系统","title_en":"We’re working with Cisco on what we think are going to be key infrastructure primitives in the new era of cybersecurity.","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2125141302501417232"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","published_at":"2026-11-24T06:12:14Z","ref":"A4","score":67,"selected":true,"source":"X：卡兹克 (@Khazix0918)","summary":"数字生命卡兹克分享自己做产品时用的两个 Prompt，一个按用户体验至上的原则审查项目交互并直接修复，一个把项目动效做到细腻丝滑水准。要点包括让 Gemini 当方案顾问、按状态变化逐项审查动效，完成后让 GPT 审查再合并上线。","title":"卡兹克分享两个优化用户体验和产品动效的 Prompt","title_en":"分享两个最近我自己做产品用来优化用户体验和产品动效的Prompt，我觉得效果还挺不错的。","url":"https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2125110224143171669"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/f1380j6hyrxn0rnz6666nu3b8","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"f1380j6hyrxn0rnz6666nu3b8","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/f1380j6hyrxn0rnz6666nu3b8","published_at":"2026-11-24T02:11:36Z","ref":"A5","score":69,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：MiniMax（稀宇科技）","summary":"MiniMax 推出 H3 Family，包含 H3、H3-Highspeed、H3-Lite、H3-Image、H3-Image Highspeed 等旗舰模型及 fal、Suno、HeyGen、Pika 等伙伴的多个扩展模型。","title":"MiniMax 发布 H3 Family 系列模型，H3 开源百日衍生模型达 1472 个、下载量超 1.48 亿次","title_en":null,"url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Maoz76fZdGNaB7tlIVxWWQ"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/zto0pspydy8330r0bvwqb6j5z","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"zto0pspydy8330r0bvwqb6j5z","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/zto0pspydy8330r0bvwqb6j5z","published_at":"2026-11-24T01:41:25Z","ref":"A6","score":88,"selected":true,"source":"ChinaTalk（RSS）","summary":"ChinaTalk 主持人 Jordan Schneider 邀请 Chris McGuire 与 Peter Harrell 紧急讨论 Nvidia 董事会在美国政府表态后一致恢复黄仁勋职务，以及美国商务部同日将 Megaspeed 列入实体清单。节目围绕出口管制执法、实体清单是否附加外国直接产品规则（FDPR）、国会相